            <div class="pill center" id="p-sweat"><svg width="44" height="60" viewBox="0 0 44 60"><path d="M22 4 C30 20 40 30 40 40 C40 51 32 58 22 58 C12 58 4 51 4 40 C4 30 14 20 22 4Z" fill="#2f6fd0" /></svg>dhidid</div>
